OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMost of the day will be dry and
OL,6,Fbright with sunny spells. Cloud will
OL,7,Fspread in from the west during the
OL,8,Fafternoon with rain following in the
OL,9,Fwest towards the evening.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FClear spells in the east at
OL,12,Ffirst otherwise the night will be
OL,13,Fcloudy with outbreaks of rain in the
OL,14,Fwest but dry elsewhere.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSaturday:FDry in the east at first,
OL,17,Frain will spread east while becoming
OL,18,Fpatchy and light during the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
